<h1 data-copy-en="Jessie" data-copy-zh="Jessie">Jessie</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Start Jessie’s tenant route, build gym Clout, and follow listening, gifts, dates and separate evening invitations." data-copy-zh="开启Jessie租客路线，积累健身房声望，推进倾听、礼物、约会及独立晚间邀请。">Start Jessie’s tenant route, build gym Clout, and follow listening, gifts, dates and separate evening invitations.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Christmas_Wine_Activity"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Intimate_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="KTV_and_Night_Club_Invitations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Four_One-Time_Room_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Closer_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Listen_to_Jessie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Listen_to_Jessie_and_Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Jessie — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/jessie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Jessie — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/jessie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Jessie — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Jessie’s route starts with your basement rental listing and a café encounter. Gym progress then opens her ordinary relationship menu, personal listening route and later dates.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Use Rent Out Apartment in your basement,30 min once, then visit Local Café for A Girl in Need. Afterwards enter her room through Visit Jessie 14:00–23:00; her portrait is at Jessie's Room.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Night_Club_Question_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="KTV_Question_Answers"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Reach Gym Clout 10 and visit her room for Jessie Notices Your Gains. Talk and ordinary gifts require Known 25, so use this gym milestone before waiting for those menus. After it, Listen to Jessie costs 60 min/30 Energy once; Closer follows for 60 min/30 Energy.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">A Girl in Need</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Local Café</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Rent Out Apartment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jessie Notices Your Gains</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Jessie's Room</td><td data-label="Requirements">Gym Clout 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What Jessie Really Needs</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Jessie's Room</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Jessie Notices Your Gains</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jessie's Rebound</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Jessie's Room; 19:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">after What Jessie Really Needs; learn Alcohol Tolerance; carry 1 Wine</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Closer</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; after Listen to Jessie</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Her separate Friend 100 story scene follows gym recognition. After it, learn Alcohol Tolerance, carry 1Wine, and visit 19:00–22:00 for Jessie's Rebound. Completion consumes the Wine and advances 240 min. This story requirement does not require the Give Wine gift button, which unlocks later at Close Friend 200.</p><p>The four room outings are Zoo at Friend 100/14:00–17:00, Fair at Friend 100/14:00–15:00, Voucher prize at Friend 100/effective 14:00–18:00, and Boardwalk at Close Friend 200/17:00–20:00 after Diane’s construction.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Four_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meeting_Jessie_and_Visiting_Her_Room"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Jessie</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Flowers</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Teddy Bear</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Teddy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Listen to Jessie</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; after Jessie Notices Your Gains</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Wine</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Wine</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+10 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Time</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; affection 400; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">45 min; 40 Energy; 30 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+50 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoo Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; Friend (100); 14:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $100; 50 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fair Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; Friend (100); 14:00–14:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $150; 45 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; Friend (100); 14:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 1 Voucher</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Sunset Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Jessie's Room; Close Friend (200); after Restoring the Boardwalk; 17:00–19:59; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; $50; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Intimate Time needs 400 affection:45 min/40 Energy/30 Calm,50 base affection and 60 player Erotic Experience, once/day, with its content access.</p><p>KTV and Night Club invitations require Crush 400 plus Listen to Jessie and Closer. Start from the venue 20:00–23:00; unbuffed costs are 120 min/$150/40 Energy at KTV or 120 min/$100/30 Energy at Night Club, with its supporter prompt. Each venue shares one daily allowance across invited NPCs.</p><p>With Christmas activities enabled, Wine with Jessie needs Close Friend 200 and 1 Wine,30 min once:1 Token,10 direct affection and 25 NPC intimacy experience. Normal room access still begins 14:00.</p><p>In Kupie's Love Training, her entry requires ordinary Friend 100, Vera’s minigame level 5 and the menu’s content access. That minigame progress and currency are separate.</p><p>Favorite stats are Strength, Stamina, Ability. Learning Alcohol Tolerance improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>A rental listing alone is not the move-in encounter; visit the café exterior afterwards.</li><li>Gym Clout 10 opens the recognition step; it is not Jessie affection or ordinary work experience.</li><li>The Fair start is 14:00–15:00. Her Voucher outing also cannot begin before room access opens at 14:00.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Dates, gifts and venue invitations</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">Christmas activities</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie’s Love Training</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Learning Alcohol Tolerance</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Christmas_Wine_Activity"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Intimate_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-KTV_and_Night_Club_Invitations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Four_One-Time_Room_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Closer_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Listen_to_Jessie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Listen_to_Jessie_and_Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Jessie 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/jessie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Jessie 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/jessie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Jessie 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Jessie路线从地下室招租及咖啡馆遭遇开始，之后通过健身房进度开放普通关系菜单、倾听路线和约会。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>在自家地下室使用出租公寓，30分钟，仅一次，再到本地咖啡馆触发需要帮助的女孩。之后可在14:00–23:00通过拜访Jessie进入Jessie的房间。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Night_Club_Question_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-KTV_Question_Answers"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>达到健身房声望10后回房间触发Jessie注意到你的变化。普通交谈与送礼要求已知25，早期请先完成健身房里程碑。之后可进行倾听Jessie，60分钟、30精力，仅一次，再进行更近一步，60分钟、30精力。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">需要帮助的女孩</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">本地咖啡馆</td><td data-label="条件">完成：出租公寓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jessie注意到你的变化</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Jessie的房间</td><td data-label="条件">健身房声望10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jessie真正需要的东西</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Jessie的房间</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100好感）；完成：Jessie注意到你的变化</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jessie的过渡之夜</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Jessie的房间；19:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">完成：Jessie真正需要的东西；已学会酒精耐受；携带葡萄酒×1</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">更近一步</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；完成：倾听Jessie</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>独立的朋友100剧情在健身房认可后出现。完成后学会酒精耐受，携带葡萄酒×1，于19:00–22:00到访触发Jessie的过渡之夜。完成时消耗该酒并推进240分钟；不要求先解锁亲密朋友200才有的普通送酒按钮。</p><p>四项房间出游为：朋友100的动物园14:00–17:00、游乐场14:00–15:00、兑换券奖品实际14:00–18:00，以及Diane建设完成后亲密朋友200的木板路17:00–20:00。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Four_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meeting_Jessie_and_Visiting_Her_Room"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Jessie 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；巧克力×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；鲜花×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送泰迪熊</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；泰迪熊×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+8；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">倾听Jessie</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；完成：Jessie注意到你的变化</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送葡萄酒</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；亲密朋友（200好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；葡萄酒×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+10；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密时光</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；好感400；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">45分钟；40精力；30镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+50；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">动物园约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；朋友（100好感）；14:00–16:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$100；50精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游园会约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；朋友（100好感）；14:00–14:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$150；45精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；朋友（100好感）；14:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；兑换券×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滨栈道日落约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Jessie的房间；亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：重修海滨木栈道；17:00–19:59；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；$50；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>亲密时光要求400好感，45分钟、40精力、30镇定，增加50基础好感和60玩家情趣经验，每天一次，另须满足内容权限。</p><p>KTV和夜店邀请要求迷恋400、倾听Jessie及更近一步完成。从场所20:00–23:00开始，未计药剂时：KTV为120分钟、$150、40精力；夜店为120分钟、$100、30精力，另需其赞助者权限。每处共用每天一次邀请额度。</p><p>开启圣诞活动后，亲密朋友200可用葡萄酒×1进行与Jessie饮酒，30分钟，仅一次，获得1代币、10直接好感和25NPC亲密经验；普通房间入口仍从14:00开放。</p><p>在Kupie 的爱之训练中，她要求普通朋友100、Vera的小游戏等级5及菜单所示内容权限；该系统进度与货币独立计算。</p><p>偏好的属性为力量、耐力、能力。学会酒精耐受可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>只刊登招租还不够，之后要到咖啡馆外触发到访。</li><li>认可事件需要健身房声望10，不是Jessie好感或普通工作经验。</li><li>游乐场开始时段只有14:00–15:00；兑换券出游也要等14:00房间入口开放。</li></ul></section>
